        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7d1c2b90-3f4a-4c6e-9a51-0b8e6f2a1c01",
      "name": "POST Claim Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "position": [
        0,
        1920
      ],
      "notes": "Why HTTP: no node for the FOI API. Asks the API whether this execution may process the event: proceed, duplicate, in_progress or stale (one transaction on the outbox row and the ordering watermark). Retry is safe: the same execution id may claim again. Fails the run on error (never process without the idempotency guard); the API sweeper flags the event NO_OUTCOME and an admin replays it."
    },
    {
