      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Why HTTP: no node for the FOI API. Maps a failed n8n execution id to the event it claimed (event_id, event, raw_request_id, foi_request_id, ministry_request_id, status; found=false when the run failed before claiming). Used by FOI Error Handler. Continues on error so the failure is still recorded and alerted."
